# Calibration OUTPUTS.
#
# `selection.json`, `summary.json` and `manifest.json` ARE committed: the protocol requires
# the selection to be frozen and committed before the sealed window may be opened, and the
# other two are the published result.
#
# `trajectory.json` is NOT — it is ~13 MB of per-bar detail, fully regenerable from the
# bundle plus this commit, and it would add a fresh 13 MB blob to history on every run. The
# manifest still records its SHA-256, so a regenerated trajectory can be checked against the
# one that produced these numbers. That makes the hash a verification rather than a duplicate.
out/**/trajectory.json
